1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:05,236
The most famous clue on Oak Island is a stone nobody alive has ever seen.

2
00:00:05,736 --> 00:00:11,625
Treasure hunters said they found it ninety feet down in the money pit, carved with strange symbols.

3
00:00:13,025 --> 00:00:15,801
Decades later, someone claimed to translate it.

4
00:00:16,021 --> 00:00:19,070
Forty feet below, two million pounds are buried.

5
00:00:19,570 --> 00:00:21,072
Then the stone went missing.

6
00:00:21,291 --> 00:00:22,209
No photo.

7
00:00:22,429 --> 00:00:23,884
No drawing from the time.

8
00:00:24,104 --> 00:00:25,372
Just the translation.

9
00:00:26,772 --> 00:00:30,490
A clue that can't be checked, promising treasure nobody's found.

10
00:00:30,710 --> 00:00:32,811
That's Oak Island in one sentence.

11
00:00:33,311 --> 00:00:36,631
Follow for the real records behind famous legends.
